- *
- * PartnerApplication:  pending → approved | rejected
- * BusinessEnrollment:   enrolled → qualifying → qualified → converted
- *
- * ── Attribution immutability ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
- *
- * INVARIANT 1: Once set, referredBy (influencerId) on a SalespersonProfile
